/-
NPT.Cert.EqData — closed forms of the partial traces of the permutation operators for the five traced-slot
combinations of the EP_3 equality groups (ep3core `tr_replica`), generic in the local dimension `n`:
`Tr_{sl,ord}(V_p) = n^e · V3_q` and `Tr†(V3_q) = V_{p'}` (data generated by an internal script,
checked by `decide +kernel`).
